// The platform sets the events array:
// { title: "Your first page in an hour", category: "html", date: "3 March" }, ...
// On the page: .menu-toggle, #site-nav, .theme-toggle, .filters with [data-filter] buttons,
// #events-status, #events

// 1. Menu: is-open, aria-expanded, Escape + returning focus

// 2. Theme: localStorage "theme", the class theme-dark, aria-pressed

// 3. renderEvents(list): article.event, h3, p.event__date, counter

// 4. Filter: one handler on .filters, aria-pressed

// On load: renderEvents(events);

